# Renders, not sources. A .wav is `nsscore-bake-audio.mjs` applied to the score
# beside it, and a -diagram.mp4 is `render-notespatial-diagram.mjs` applied to
# the same pair — both regenerable, and between 7 and 95 MB each. The .nsscore
# files they come from are committed, because those are the composition.
*.wav
*-diagram.mp4
